<li>&lt;a href="1760"&gt;1760&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="John%20Michell"&gt;John Michell&lt;/a&gt; suggests éarthquakes are caused by one layer of rocks rubbing against another</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1776"&gt;1776&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="James%20Keir"&gt;James Keir&lt;/a&gt; suggests that some rocks, such as those at the &lt;a href="Giant%27s%20Causeway"&gt;Giant's Causeway&lt;/a&gt;, might have been formed by the crystallisation of molten lava</li>
