<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Fluid%20dynamics"&gt;Fluid dynamics&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Acoustic%20theory"&gt;Acoustic theory&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Maxwell%27s%20equations"&gt;Maxwell's equations&lt;/a&gt; that govern &lt;a href="electromagnetism"&gt;electromagnetism&lt;/a&gt;</li>
