<li>&lt;a href="Robert%20G.%20Parr"&gt;Robert G. Parr&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="John%20Pople"&gt;John Pople&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Henry%20Eyring"&gt;Henry Eyring&lt;/a&gt;</li>
