<li>&lt;a href="Commercial%20law"&gt;Commercial law&lt;/a&gt;, often considered to be part of &lt;a href="civil%20law"&gt;civil law&lt;/a&gt;, covers &lt;a href="business"&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="commerce"&gt;commerce&lt;/a&gt; relations including &lt;a href="sales"&gt;sales&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="business%20entity"&gt;business entities&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
