<doc id="1145" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1145" title="Type II error">
Type II error

Dina &lt;a href="tes%20hipotesa%20statistik"&gt;tes hipotesa statistik&lt;/a&gt;, Type II error miboga gagalna keur nolak &lt;a href="null%20hypothesis"&gt;null hypothesis&lt;/a&gt; nu salah (contona. kasalahan narima hypothesis nu salah).
