<li>&lt;a href="Sling%20psychrometer"&gt;Sling psychrometer&lt;/a&gt; - humidity</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Stream%20gauge"&gt;Stream gauge&lt;/a&gt; - stréam flow (see: &lt;a href="discharge%20%28hydrology%29"&gt;discharge (hydrology)&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
