Public affairs

Public affairs ngawengku kabéh watesan kaasup &lt;a href="public%20policy"&gt;public policy&lt;/a&gt; saperti ogé &lt;a href="public%20administration"&gt;public administration&lt;/a&gt;, duanana raket pakait sarta ngagambarkeun kaayaan &lt;a href="political%20science"&gt;political science&lt;/a&gt; ogé &lt;a href="economics"&gt;economics&lt;/a&gt;.
