Sebaran kondisional

Diberekeun dua sebaran gabungan &lt;a href="variabel%20random"&gt;variabel random&lt;/a&gt; X jeung Y, sebaran kondisional probabiliti of Y given X (written "Y | X") is the &lt;a href="probability%20distribution"&gt;probability distribution&lt;/a&gt; of Y when X is known to be a particular value.
For &lt;a href="discrete%20random%20variable"&gt;discrete random variable&lt;/a&gt;s, the &lt;a href="conditional%20probability"&gt;conditional probability&lt;/a&gt; mass function can be written as P(Y = y | X = x). From the definition of &lt;a href="conditional%20probability"&gt;conditional probability&lt;/a&gt;, this is
